  "operations": "Read-only source/official documentation and npm/CDN distribution. No store HEAD or API, example, import, authorization, tracking event, subscription, delivery or worker executed. Only isolated local new form GET, temporary fictional DOM values and account locale ES/EN with ES restored for captures.",
  "specific_contracts": [
    "Customer historical import enumerates buyers from exposed order pages, not an independently enumerated registered-user database. Existing identities/email/phone can match profiles; commerce and contact permission remain distinct.",
    "First Next performs HEAD store reachability then can save a draft account/integration/properties. Customer choice writes pending/import timestamps before actual processing. API status check queries orders and can activate/schedule jobs; it does not check browser SDK installation.",
    "No current primary evidence confirms inherited static IP 5.161.64.254. Replace with current authorization details confirmed by Hellotext support before sending editable ticket model.",
    "Fenicio products use code; presentations become variants with SKU reference, stock-backed state and live lookup response. Order idOrden/numeroOrden, amount/currency and delivery modality versus derived lifecycle event are distinct; service lines without product SKU omitted.",
    "Queue/API/subscription availability and incomplete or later data prevent guaranteed minutes-to-sync or complete lifecycle/history claims. Activation not full import proof.",
    "Released 2.6.0 initialize asynchronous, no automatic page.viewed; explicit actual views once and session/identity/received versus processed remain distinct."
  ]
